{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22412","headline":"寄微之三首 二 · 白居易","name":"寄微之三首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"君游襄阳日，我在长安住。\n今君在通州，我过襄阳去。\n襄阳九里郭，楼堞连云树。\n顾此稍依依，是君旧游处。\n苍茫蒹葭水，中有浔阳路。\n此去更相思，江西少亲故。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22412.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22412","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}